  },
  "other-faces": {
   "note": "near-blank by evidence - rail bands estimated; axis conventions per viewer3d.js as the siblings"
  },
  "power": {
   "confidence": "datasheet",
   "note": "datasheet-table - JNP10K-PWR-AC2 5.5 kW each as the MX10004; the guide also lists the AC3 unit (gap). The MX10000 and MX10008/MX10016 datasheets both state typical power consumption 12 kW, fully loaded, naming no ambient or side - carried as power-typical-w. The guide rates every FRU by ambient (Table 47, including the fan trays: JNP10008-FAN 475 W, -FAN2 1207 W, -FAN3 1620 W) and works an example of 14,110 W for eight MX10K-LC2101 in a redundant configuration (2710 W + 11,400 W) - a sample, not carried"
